<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cardoso confirms CVRD selloff.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cardoso confirms CVRD selloff.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian President Fernando Henrique Cardoso confirmed his government intends to privatise state mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD) in the first quarter of 1997, despite mounting opposition to the sale.</p>
<p>&quot;We intend to begin privatising Vale do Rio Doce in the first quarter of next year,&quot; Cardoso said in a weekly radio address.</p>
</text>
